menu "UART_ECHO_Polling testcase"

config UART_ECHO_RX_TIMEOUT_POLLS
    int "Echo RX timeout (poll iterations, not milliseconds)"
    range 1 100000000
    default 10000
    help
        Polling budget for receiving one byte. A timeout with no buffered data is normal
        and continue to receive.

config UART_ECHO_TX_TIMEOUT_POLLS
    int "Echo TX timeout (poll iterations, not milliseconds)"
    range 1 100000000
    default 1000000
    help
        Budget poll for one time Transmit a byte echo. When error, testcase write receives and continues to
        receive, not from regui the byte. Baud and clock share the configuration of FPGA_Terminal.

endmenu
